{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2023-01-26 11:15:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND BY 8% TO $1.75 PER SHARE', 'text': "MOVE MARKS 41 ST CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF QUARTERLY DIVIDEND INCREASES ON COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD) HAS INCREASED THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK BY 13 CENTS PER SHARE—FROM $1.62 TO $1.75 PER SHARE—REPRESENTING AN EIGHT PERCENT INCREASE."}